  "subject": "理工学系_情报工学系",
  "text": "设随机变量 $X$ 在区间 $[-1, 1]$ 上服从均匀分布。\n\n**a)** 求 $X$ 的概率密度函数 $f_X(x)$。\n\n**b)** 设 $Y = \\dfrac{1}{1 + e^{-X}}$，其中 $e$ 为自然对数的底数。求 $Y$ 的概率密度函数 $f_Y(y)$。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "均匀分布的性质",
    "概率密度函数",
    "变量变换",
    "反函数的导数"
  ],
  "question_type": "概率密度函数计算",
  "method": [
    "均匀分布定义",
    "变量变换公式"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "由均匀分布定义写出 $f_X$",
    "建立 Y 与 X 的函数关系",
    "求反函数和其导数",
    "应用变量变换公式求 $f_Y$"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "distribution_transformation",
    "template": "$Y = g(X)$，已知 $f_X$，求 $f_Y$",
    "variable_count": 1
  },
  "difficulty": 3,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "a) 求 $f_X(x)$",
      "steps": [
        "由于 X 在 $[-1, 1]$ 上均匀分布，区间长度为 $1 - (-1) = 2$",
        "概率密度函数：",
        "$$f_X(x) = \\begin{cases} \\dfrac{1}{2}, & x \\in [-1, 1] \\\\ 0, & \\text{其他} \\end{cases}$$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "b) 求 $f_Y(y)$",
      "steps": [
        "由 $Y = \\dfrac{1}{1 + e^{-X}}$ 求反函数。令 $y = \\dfrac{1}{1+e^{-x}}$",
        "$1 + e^{-x} = \\dfrac{1}{y}$",
        "$e^{-x} = \\dfrac{1}{y} - 1 = \\dfrac{1-y}{y}$",
        "$-x = \\ln\\left(\\dfrac{1-y}{y}\\right)$",
        "$x = \\ln\\left(\\dfrac{y}{1-y}\\right)$",
        "",
        "求导数：$\\dfrac{dx}{dy} = \\dfrac{d}{dy}\\ln\\left(\\dfrac{y}{1-y}\\right)$",
        "$= \\dfrac{1-y}{y} \\cdot \\dfrac{d}{dy}\\left(\\dfrac{y}{1-y}\\right)$",
        "$= \\dfrac{1-y}{y} \\cdot \\dfrac{(1-y) + y}{(1-y)^2}$",
        "$= \\dfrac{1-y}{y} \\cdot \\dfrac{1}{(1-y)^2}$",
        "$= \\dfrac{1}{y(1-y)}$",
        "",
        "当 $X \\in [-1, 1]$ 时，$Y$ 的取值范围：",
        "$Y(-1) = \\dfrac{1}{1+e} \\approx 0.268$",
        "$Y(1) = \\dfrac{1}{1+e^{-1}} = \\dfrac{e}{1+e} \\approx 0.732$",
        "所以 $y \\in \\left(\\dfrac{1}{1+e}, \\dfrac{e}{1+e}\\right)$",
        "",
        "应用变量变换公式：",
        "$$f_Y(y) = f_X\\left(\\ln\\dfrac{y}{1-y}\\right) \\left|\\dfrac{dx}{dy}\\right| = \\dfrac{1}{2} \\cdot \\dfrac{1}{y(1-y)}$$",
        "",
        "因此：$$f_Y(y) = \\begin{cases} \\dfrac{1}{2y(1-y)}, & y \\in \\left(\\dfrac{1}{1+e}, \\dfrac{e}{1+e}\\right) \\\\ 0, & \\text{其他} \\end{cases}$$"
      ]
    }
  ],
