      "math_structure": {
        "type": "linear_transformation",
        "template": "$Y = aX + b$，$a \\neq 0$",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "概率密度函数",
          "steps": [
            "$f_X(x) = \\dfrac{1}{2}$，$x \\in [0,2]$",
            "由 $Y = 2X + 1$ 得 $X = \\dfrac{Y-1}{2}$，$\\dfrac{dX}{dY} = \\dfrac{1}{2}$",
            "当 $X \\in [0,2]$ 时，$Y \\in [1,5]$",
            "$$f_Y(y) = f_X\\left(\\dfrac{y-1}{2}\\right) \\left|\\dfrac{dx}{dy}\\right| = \\dfrac{1}{2} \\cdot \\dfrac{1}{2} = \\dfrac{1}{4}$$",
            "$$f_Y(y) = \\begin{cases} \\dfrac{1}{4}, & y \\in [1,5] \\\\ 0, & \\text{其他} \\end{cases}$$"
          ]
        }
